  "headline": "Bareskrim Polri Expands Victim List In Former Police Chief Case",
  "seoTitle": "Bareskrim Expands Wiretap Victim List",
  "metaDescription": "Indonesian investigators have identified new individuals targeted in a wiretapping case involving former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Bareskrim Polri identified additional victims of unauthorized wiretapping involving former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit.",
    "The list of individuals allegedly targeted includes prominent public figures such as Raffi Ahmad, Nagita Slavina, and Najwa Shihab.",
    "Previous investigations into the case explored allegations of treason related to the surveillance of high-ranking state officials."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police's Criminal Investigation Agency, Bareskrim Polri, continues to investigate a high-profile case involving alleged illegal surveillance conducted by former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit and his associates. Initial inquiries into the matter were prompted by accusations that the group surveilled state officials, including President Prabowo Subianto, during and after the 2024 presidential election period. Several public figures and officials, including Erick Thohir and labor leader Said Iqbal, have publicly claimed to be on the list of monitored individuals. While some officials have denied involvement in the activity, authorities are currently working to determine the origin of the orders that authorized these surveillance operations. The ongoing investigation has sparked significant public and political debate, with discussions focused on the legality of the wiretaps and the potential political implications for the individuals identified in the case files.",
